OL,3,GNEWSADoubts over new law to tackle
OL,4,Aantisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopkeeper previously plagued by
OL,7,Fantisocial behaviour has questioned the
OL,8,Feffectiveness of new measures,
OL,9,Fintroduced by government.
OL,11,FLaunched on Monday, Respect Orders
OL,12,Fpartly replace older Anti-social
OL,13,FBehaviour Orders (Asbo), and offer
OL,14,Fpolice and councils powers such as
OL,15,Fbanning people from certain areas.
OL,17,FHowever, Rebecca Sutton, from Town
OL,18,FBarbers in Market Drayton, said she
OL,19,Ffeared they would be ineffective and
OL,20,Fmerely shift problems from one area to
OL,21,Fanother.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
