OL,3,GNEWSADoubts over new law to tackle
OL,4,Aantisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said Respect Orders gave
OL,7,Fthe police and local authorities a
OL,8,Fwider range of punishments to address
OL,9,Fantisocial behaviour, enabling them to
OL,10,F"take stronger enforcement action
OL,11,Fagainst relentless adult offenders".
